{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"　\n自撮り〜✌️"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2SVEGMG82F5H00HMHWDKB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">澤部さん、ライブみにきてくださいました！♡お忙しいのに、いつもライブに足を運んでくださって嬉しかったです。ありがとうございました👔🌸2日目は土田さんも来てくださいました！ありがとうございました。ライブ翌日の日曜のへそ📻でも色々とお話しして下さって嬉しかったです。土田さんとは3人で写真撮り損ねた🥲それだけは後悔🥺"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2SWE614GBYCV90RTF6DN3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2SXCGDANETTSE8MSK90YC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2SYED9SRJ7NB0PXFHVHQ4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2SZDXHE0F089W1F1QRTTP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2T0E94QG83PRHN6Z30E11","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2T1CMNMFDFCN0Q96827G9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">おばあちゃんになっても、ずっとずっと仲良しでいたい♡もちろん、2期ちゃんたちも♡"}],"source":"archive"}